#: build/form/form-label/block.json
#: includes/blocks/form/form-label/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid "A form field's label, associated with its axell/form-control sibling via a matching id/for pair. Can be visually hidden (still read by screen readers) via the \"Visually hidden\" toggle. A required-field asterisk, if wanted, is just part of the label's own text content (e.g. embed a styled span directly) — not a separate attribute."
